    "title": "Smart City Expo",
    "description": "Get ready for Smart City Expo World Congress, Tomorrow.Mobility World Congress, Tomorrow.Building World Congress & Tomorrow.BlueEconomy World Congress.\r\n\r\nRemember you will need to download the app to access your digital badge and enter the venue.\r\n\r\nThis app offers the following features:\r\n\r\n- Access to your Digital Badge to enter the venue.\r\n- Recommendations based on your interests.\r\n- Access to the Agenda with all the detailed information (events, dates, hours, locations, tracks...) of the congress program, agoras & breakout sessions.\r\n- Access to the Exhibitors\u2019 list, Venue map and Booth Activities to make the most of your visit.\r\n- Networking tool to start connections with attendees and exhibitors.\r\n- List of Congress speakers including detailed information.\r\n- My Favorites: to personalise your favourite speakers, sessions, exhibitors and make your own schedule.\r\n- Rating sessions: give us your feedback!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get ready for Smart City Expo World Congress, Tomorrow.Mobility World Congress, Tomorrow.Building World Congress &amp; Tomorrow.BlueEconomy World Congress.<br><br>Remember you will need to download the app to access your digital badge and enter the venue.<br><br>This app offers the following features:<br><br>- Access to your Digital Badge to enter the venue.<br>- Recommendations based on your interests.<br>- Access to the Agenda with all the detailed information (events, dates, hours, locations, tracks...) of the congress program, agoras &amp; breakout sessions.<br>- Access to the Exhibitors\u2019 list, Venue map and Booth Activities to make the most of your visit.<br>- Networking tool to start connections with attendees and exhibitors.<br>- List of Congress speakers including detailed information.<br>- My Favorites: to personalise your favourite speakers, sessions, exhibitors and make your own schedule.<br>- Rating sessions: give us your feedback!",
